---
import { href, ISO_7372_URL, ISO_TC154_URL, UNECE_UNCEFACT_URL, UNECE_UNTDED_URL } from '../lib/site'

const link = 'underline decoration-un/60 hover:text-un-deep'
---

<footer class="mt-16 border-t border-line bg-mist">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
      <span class="font-mono font-semibold text-ink">UN<span class="name-slash">/</span>TDED</span>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-3">
      The content is the United Nations Trade Data Elements Directory, 2005 edition
      (ECE/TRADE/362, ISO 7372:2005). This website and the machine-readable dataset
      that it publishes are a member contribution and a pilot project to the{' '}
      <a class={link} href={UNECE_UNCEFACT_URL}>United Nations Economic Commission for Europe (UNECE)</a>,
      through UN/CEFACT, and to{' '}
      <a class={link} href={ISO_TC154_URL}>ISO/TC 154</a>. Neither organization has
      endorsed them, and the accuracy of the data presented here is not guaranteed.
      The content is reproduced from the publication with attribution to the United
      Nations and UNECE.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2">
      Official pages of the publication:{' '}
      <a class={link} href={UNECE_UNTDED_URL}>UN/TDED — UNECE</a>
      {' · '}
      <a class={link} href={ISO_7372_URL}>ISO 7372 — ISO</a>
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2">
      <a class={link} href={href('/publication')}>Publication</a>
      {' · '}
      <a class={link} href={href('/ontology')}>Ontology</a>
      {' · '}
      <a class={link} href={href('/bridges')}>Bridges</a>
      {' · '}
      <a class={link} href={href('/changes')}>Edition changes</a>
      {' · '}
      <a class={link} href={href('/guides')}>Guides</a>
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2">
      <a class={link} href="https://github.com/untded">GitHub organization</a>
      {' · '}
      <a class={link} href={href('/about')}>Mandate and governance</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
